{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43470","headline":"纪游东观山 · 无名氏","name":"纪游东观山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑰奇恣搜讨，贝阙青瑶房。\n才隘疑永巷，俄敞如华堂。\n玉梁窈浮溪，琼户正当窗。\n仙佛肖彷佛，钟鼓鍧击撞。\n贔贔左顾龟，狺狺欲吠[尨]。\n丹竈俨亡恙，芝田霭生香。\n搏噬千怪聚，绚烂五色光。\n更无一尘涴，但觉六月凉。\n玲珑穿屡折，诘曲通三湘。\n神鬼若剜刻，乾坤真混茫。\n入如深夜暗，出喜皦日光。\n隔世惊瞬息，异境难揣量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}